CM_ SG_ 532 STS_RKE "already signal available in MBFM1. as per XUV for PKE variant considered from MBFM7.";
CM_ SG_ 532 REQ_TFA_DISPLAY "for U321 this signal is protected  - it is required for TPMS";
CM_ SG_ 532 REQ_TFA_PATTERN "for U321 this signal is protected  - it is required for TPMS";
CM_ SG_ 532 TPMS_SYSTEM_FAULT "TPMS Malfunction Indication - Sensor Low Battery/ Transmitter Fault

Bit    description
0      Front Left tyre
1      Front Right tyre
2      Rear Right tyre
3      Rear Left tyre
4      TPMS Receiver Fault


  0 : Normal
  1 : Faulty";
CM_ SG_ 532 TPMS_LEAKAGE_ALERT "Bit Position Description :-
Bit 0 : FL tyre
Bit 1 : FR tyre
Bit 2 : RR tyre
Bit 3 : RL tyre
Bit 4 : Spare tyre

Value Description :-
0 : Normal
1 : Leakage";
CM_ SG_ 532 TPMS_SIGNAL_MISSING "Bit Position Description :-
Bit 0 : FL tyre
Bit 1 : FR tyre
Bit 2 : RR tyre
Bit 3 : RL tyre

Value Description :-
0 : Normal
1 : Signal missing";
CM_ SG_ 532 TPMS_ID_NOT_LEARNT "tpms id not learned";
CM_ SG_ 532 HIGH_TYRE_PRESSURE_ALERT "monitor high tyre pressure for All tyres.";
CM_ SG_ 532 HIGH_TYRE_TEMPERATURE_ALERT "monitoring temparature of All tyres.";
CM_ SG_ 532 LOW_TYRE_PRESSURE_ALERT "indication for low tyre pressure";
CM_ SG_ 532 SPARE_TYRE_SWAP "indication for spare tyre swape";
CM_ SG_ 532 TPMS_PROGRAM_MODE "programming mode for TPMS";
CM_ SG_ 832 STS_BRAKE_FLUID_LVL "status of break fluid level - IN LOW END

Bosch team confirmed on 23.06.2015 - Brake Fluid information not required to function ABS / ESP.";
CM_ SG_ 832 ODOMTR_READING "ODOMETER VALUE";
CM_ SG_ 529 INDC_LOW_FUEL "indication for low fuel warning. protection for disel platform.. it may be required in gasolin platform. 
1 bit information is sufficient to transmit status. actual fuel level would be detected using FUEL_LEVEL CAN signal.";
CM_ SG_ 529 STS_PARK_BRK "Protection for W105 - hand brake signal indication.";
CM_ SG_ 529 SERVICE_REMINDER "To be defined during Phase II development";
CM_ SG_ 529 RST_ACK_AFE "ACknowledge from Cluster to IS that it has reset the AFE.";
CM_ SG_ 529 DIST_TO_EMPTY "Distance to empty";
CM_ SG_ 529 AVG_KMPL "Average kilometer per litre";
CM_ SG_ 704 EVEN_PARITY_BIT "Transmitter:
If no. of 1s in Bit 0 to Bit 6 of Byte 0 is ODD, then Bit 7=1 to make it EVEN Parity.
If no. of 1s in Bit 0 to Bit 6 of Byte 0 is EVEN, then Bit 7=0 to retain EVEN Parity.
Receiver: 
No of 1s in Byte 0 should be EVEN to check Even Parity.";
CM_ SG_ 304 ENG_OIL_PRESSURE "Engine oil pressure status normal/low  switch is HW to Cluster.";
CM_ SG_ 292 STS_ENG "during vehicle crank all partner ECU would observe Battery Voltage dip.

 
hence Network monitoring should be OFF during this event & Low voltage DTC should not logged by any ECU.";
CM_ SG_ 292 BRK_PEDAL "MBFM - during panic braking HAZARD LAMP will be ON.";
